## 🧪 Testing Guidelines

### Always Test

- **Unit tests** for services, repositories, utilities
- **E2E tests** for complete workflows
- **Manual tests** for user-facing features
- **Performance tests** for optimizations

### Test Coverage Goals

- **Critical paths**: 100% (job creation, step delegation, callbacks)
- **Happy paths**: 90%+ (all main features)
- **Error paths**: 80%+ (exception handling)

### Testing Commands

```bash
pnpm test                    # Unit tests
pnpm test:e2e                # E2E tests
pnpm test:cov                # With coverage
./setpoint-evals/run-all.sh             # Core SEs
./setpoint-evals/run-all.sh --all-workflows  # All SEs
```

